        }
      ],
      "id": "post_07098522d1ed802e79b786cf_b227",
      "props": {
        "language": "text"
      },
      "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [],
      "id": "post_07098522d1ed802e79b786cf_b228",
      "props": {
        "divider": true
      },
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          },
          "text": "ID vs 名称：自动两种都认",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_07098522d1ed802e79b786cf_b229",
      "props": {
        "anchor": "ID-vs-名称自动两种都认",
        "level": 2
      },
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "category",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " / ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "tag",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " / ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "creator",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " 这类字段背后都是 ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "{id, name}",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " 的实体。语法允许你随便用：",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_07098522d1ed802e79b786cf_b230",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "输入 ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          },
          "text": "名称",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "（如 ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "category:餐饮",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "）→ 系统自动翻译成对应 ID 再去匹配；",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_07098522d1ed802e79b786cf_b232",
      "props": {},
      "type": "bulletListItem"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "输入 ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          },
          "text": "ID",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "（如 ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "category:cat_abc123",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "）→ 直接按 ID 匹配；",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_07098522d1ed802e79b786cf_b234",
      "props": {},
      "type": "bulletListItem"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "同名实体（比如两个都叫\"打车\"的标签）→ 全部命中，符合直觉；",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_07098522d1ed802e79b786cf_b236",
      "props": {},
      "type": "bulletListItem"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "名称在元数据里",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          },
          "text": "不存在",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " → 退化为按字面量匹配，不会报错（也就不会命中任何账单）。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_07098522d1ed802e79b786cf_b238",
      "props": {},
      "type": "bulletListItem"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "children": [],
          "content": [
            {
              "styles": {},
              "text": "优先推荐用名称——更直觉、可读性更好。需要分享/导出查询语句、且要保证语义不随重命名漂移时，才需要切到 ID。",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "id": "post_07098522d1ed802e79b786cf_b240",
          "props": {},
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "content": [],
      "id": "post_07098522d1ed802e79b786cf_b239",
      "props": {},
      "type": "quote"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [],
      "id": "post_07098522d1ed802e79b786cf_b241",
      "props": {
        "divider": true
      },
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          },
          "text": "实战案例",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_07098522d1ed802e79b786cf_b242",
      "props": {
        "anchor": "实战案例",
        "level": 2
      },
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "# 1. 找出本月所有大于 500 元的非周期支出\nq:type:expense AND amount:>500 AND recent:1M AND -has:scheduled\n\n# 2. 旅行相关消费——餐饮或交通分类，限定 USD\nq:(category:餐饮 OR category:交通) AND tag:旅行 AND currency:USD\n\n# 3. 备注里有\"报销\"但还没贴发票（无图片）\nq:报销 AND -has:assets\n\n# 4. 所有非\"日常\"分类的小额收入\nq:type:income AND amount:<100 AND -category:日常\n\n# 5. 上半年餐饮 + 标签为家庭的所有账单\nq:category:餐饮 AND tag:家庭 AND time:[2025-01-01 TO 2025-06-30]\n",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_07098522d1ed802e79b786cf_b243",
      "props": {
        "language": "text"
      },
      "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [],
      "id": "post_07098522d1ed802e79b786cf_b244",
      "props": {
        "divider": true
      },
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          },
          "text": "实现速览（给开发者）",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_07098522d1ed802e79b786cf_b245",
      "props": {
        "anchor": "实现速览给开发者",
        "level": 2
      },
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "src/ledger/filter-query/index.ts",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " 是一个三段式纯管道：",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_07098522d1ed802e79b786cf_b246",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "parseFilterQuery(query)        : string → RawAST | null      // 不依赖任何外部状态\ncompileFilterQuery(ast, ctx)   : RawAST × Context → CompiledAST | null\n                                                              // 在此把 name 解析为 id、field 收敛为类型化节点\nmatchFilterQuery(compiled, bill): CompiledAST × Bill → boolean\n                                                              // 纯求值，零 context 依赖\n",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_07098522d1ed802e79b786cf_b247",
      "props": {
        "language": "text"
      },
      "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "热路径请用 ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "createBillMatcher(filter, ctx)",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "（",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "src/ledger/utils.ts",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "）：parse + compile 仅在创建闭包时执行一次，每个 bill 只走最后一段求值——和直接的 ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "filter.includes(...)",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " 同量级开销。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_07098522d1ed802e79b786cf_b248",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "import { createBillMatcher } from \"@/ledger/utils\";\n\nconst matcher = createBillMatcher(filter, {\n    categories: allCategories,\n    tags: allTags,\n    users: allUsers,\n    baseCurrency: meta.baseCurrency,\n});\n\nconst result = bills.filter(matcher);\n",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_07098522d1ed802e79b786cf_b249",
      "props": {
        "language": "ts"
      },
      "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "设计上没有任何模块级可变状态，AST/Context 都是纯数据，可以原样移植到 Swift / Kotlin / Rust（带关联值的 enum + 普通函数）。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_07098522d1ed802e79b786cf_b250",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [],
      "id": "post_07098522d1ed802e79b786cf_b251",
      "props": {
        "divider": true
      },
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          },
          "text": "已知限制与扩展方向",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_07098522d1ed802e79b786cf_b252",
      "props": {
        "anchor": "已知限制与扩展方向",
        "level": 2
      },
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "当前 ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "time:>2025-01-01",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " 在等号语义里按「同一天」匹配；需要精确到小时/分钟，请改用 ISO 完整时间戳 + ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": ">=",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " / ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "<=",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_07098522d1ed802e79b786cf_b254",
      "props": {},
      "type": "bulletListItem"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "不支持模糊匹配（",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "*",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " / ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "~",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "）和正则——备注子串匹配走的是 ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "String.includes",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_07098522d1ed802e79b786cf_b256",
      "props": {},
      "type": "bulletListItem"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "recent",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " 的 unit 透传给 ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "dayjs.subtract",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "，常用 ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "d",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "（天）/",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "w",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "（周）/",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "M",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "（月）/",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "y",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "（年）。注意 ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "M",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " 是月、",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "m",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " 是分钟。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_07098522d1ed802e79b786cf_b258",
      "props": {},
      "type": "bulletListItem"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "没有缓存层——",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "createBillMatcher",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " 每次创建都会 parse+compile。如果你在 UI 里需要响应式，把它包在 ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "useMemo",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " / ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "computed",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " 里。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_07098522d1ed802e79b786cf_b260",
      "props": {},
      "type": "bulletListItem"
    }
  ],
